OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a chilly start it will be
OL,6,Fa mainly dry and bright day. Just the
OL,7,Fodd shower will develop, mainly during
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FBright intervals and a few
OL,11,Fshowers during the evening. Showers
OL,12,Fwill die out overnight with some clear
OL,13,Fspells developing, these mainly in the
OL,14,Feast.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FA largely dry day with sunny
OL,17,Fspells and feeling quite warm. Cloud
OL,18,Fwill increase in the afternoon to
OL,19,Fbring the odd light shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
